Sample ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated, Needs Calibration
Hardness Value: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Tensile Strength: float between 0.0 and 5000.0
Corrosion Resistance: Excellent, Good, Fair, Poor
Approval Status: Approved, Rejected, Pending
Crystal Structure: Cubic, Hexagonal, Tetragonal, Orthorhombic, Monoclinic, Triclinic
Microstructure Type: Ferrite, Pearlite, Martensite, Austenite, Cementite, Bainite
Thermal Property: Glass Transition, Melting Point, Crystallization, Decomposition, Phase Transition
Test Results: Pass, Fail, Partial, Inconclusive
